    "ans": "B",
    "why": "rematch 再赛，同一对对手再交手一次。",
    "kd": ""
   },
   {
    "type": "适当形式填空",
    "ask": "用所给单词的适当形式填空。",
    "listen": "",
    "zh": "",
    "stem": "They have had three ______ this year. (rematch)",
    "opts": [],
    "ans": "rematches",
    "why": "three 后面用复数，rematch 以 ch 结尾加 es。",
    "kd": "变形"
   },
