    "ans": "A",
    "why": "输了想和同一个对手再比一次，re-（再）+ match：rematch。",
    "kd": ""
   },
   {
    "type": "选词填空",
    "ask": "从 rematch、replay 中选一个填空。",
    "listen": "",
    "zh": "",
    "stem": "The game ended in a draw, so there will be a ______.",
    "opts": [],
    "ans": "replay",
    "why": "因为平局要重赛一场，用 replay；rematch 是同一对手另约再战。",
    "kd": "易混"
